<title>USA: Taubman names Lisa Payne CFO.</title>
<headline>Taubman names Lisa Payne CFO.</headline>
<dateline>BLOOMFIELD HILLS, Mich. 1997-01-08</dateline>
<text>
<p>Taubman Centers Inc said it named Lisa Payne as executive vice president and chief financial officer.</p>
<p>Payne was formerly a vice president of the real estate department at Goldman Sachs, Taubman said.</p>
<p>She replaces Bernard Winograd, who resigned in December to take another job, said the real estate investment trust.</p>
<p>((--Chicago Newsdesk 312-408-8787))</p>
